                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff0177ce-80e2-3bad-83b7-a2736239b2a5",
                                        "entry_id": "c1d7777f-bbf5-30ba-b4b9-3c0a8be57feb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An animal that seizes or shakes another by the throat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87e6c51b-af02-4f24-8035-012665fc7dc9",
                                                "sense_id": "ff0177ce-80e2-3bad-83b7-a2736239b2a5",
                                                "text": "The person owning a dog which had destroyed sheep could be made to pay for the damage; but the Court should also have an undoubted power to order incurable sheep-worriers to be destroyed."
